# Cashya Shoppy – Django E-commerce Backend

A full-featured **Django e-commerce backend** with admin panel to manage products, orders, and customers.

Docker images are available at:
👉 [Docker Hub – infominsolutions/cashya-shoppy](https://hub.docker.com/r/infominsolutions/cashya-shoppy)

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Development Mode

```bash
docker volume create cashya-shoppy-data

docker run -d \
  --name cashya-shoppy-dev \
  -p 8000:8000 \
  -v cashya-shoppy-data:/app/data \
  -e DEBUG=1 \
  -e ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1 \
  -e RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=test_key \
  -e TOTP_SECRET=test_secret \
  --restart unless-stopped \
  infominsolutions/cashya-shoppy:latest-dev
```

Visit: **[http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000)**

---

### Production Mode

```bash
docker volume create cashya-shoppy-data

docker run -d \
  --name cashya-shoppy-prod \
  -p 8000:8000 \
  -v cashya-shoppy-data:/app/data \
  -e DEBUG=0 \
  -e ALLOWED_HOSTS=your-domain.com \
  -e RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=your_recaptcha_key \
  -e TOTP_SECRET=your_totp_secret \
  --restart unless-stopped \
  infominsolutions/cashya-shoppy:latest
```

---

## 🐳 Using in Docker Compose

Add this to your `docker-compose.yml`:

```yaml
services:
    cashya-shoppy:
        image: infominsolutions/cashya-shoppy:latest
        container_name: cashya-shoppy
        restart: unless-stopped
        ports:
            - "8000:8000"
        volumes:
            - cashya-data:/app/data
        environment:
            - DEBUG=0
            - ALLOWED_HOSTS=your-domain.com
            - RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=your_recaptcha_key
            - TOTP_SECRET=your_totp_secret

volumes:
    cashya-data:
```

Run:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

---

## ⚙️ Environment Variables

**Required:**

-   `DEBUG` → `1` (dev), `0` (prod)
-   `ALLOWED_HOSTS` → Comma-separated hostnames
-   `RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY` → reCAPTCHA secret
-   `TOTP_SECRET` → TOTP secret key

---

## 📂 Admin & API

-   **Admin panel**: [http://localhost:8000/admin/](http://localhost:8000/admin/)

    ```bash
    docker exec -it cashya-shoppy-dev python manage.py createsuperuser
    ```

-   **API base URL**: [http://localhost:8000/api/](http://localhost:8000/api/)

